	(text "ADC chain: mux U1201 -> buffer U1202 -> ADS7056 U1203 (Ti135 sheet 13; front end as on the Agilex 3 card, 2.5 MSPS).\nMux: X0 GND (zero ref), X1 1V0, X2 1V8, X3 3V3/2, X4 isoada2, X5 1V35, X6 isoada3, X7 isoada1.\nFull scale 0..3.3 V (AVDD = reference, 3V3_analog). DVDD on 3V3: SPI and selects straight to bank 33."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 17.78 0)
